<script setup>import {ref} from 'vue';import {RouterLink} from 'vue-router';import {articles} from '../data/store';const selected=ref(null)</script>
<template><section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">THE YUWO JOURNAL</div><h1>Kitchen sink guides<br><em>& useful advice.</em></h1><p>Simple, honest answers before you buy, from choosing the right size to keeping your sink like new.</p></section><section class="container article-page"><div v-if="!selected" class="article-grid full-articles"><button v-for="a in articles" :key="a.title" class="article-card article-button" @click="selected=a"><img :src="a.image" :alt="a.title"><div><small>{{a.type}} · {{a.read}}</small><h3>{{a.title}}</h3><p>{{a.excerpt}}</p><span class="text-link">Read article →</span></div></button></div><article v-else class="article-reading"><button class="text-link back-link" @click="selected=null">← Back to all guides</button><div class="eyebrow">{{selected.type}} · {{selected.read}}</div><h1>{{selected.title}}</h1><img :src="selected.image" :alt="selected.title"><p>{{selected.excerpt}}</p><h2>Start with the space you have</h2><p>Before choosing a kitchen sink, measure the inside width of your sink cabinet and check the available countertop depth. The sink needs to fit the cabinet opening, while the countertop cut-out must follow the product template.</p><h2>Choose the installation style</h2><p>An undermount sink sits below the counter for a seamless edge. A topmount sink rests on top of the counter and is often simpler to replace. Discuss the countertop material and installation with your contractor before ordering.</p><h2>Plan ahead with your contractor</h2><p>Choose your sink before the countertop is cut. Share the sink dimensions and cutting template with your stone fabricator, and confirm the faucet and plumbing requirements.</p><RouterLink to="/collections/all" class="btn primary">Explore YUWO sinks →</RouterLink></article></section></template>
